{
  "comment": "Which rpId a page's origin may use (WebAuthn §5.1.3/§5.1.4, the HTML standard's 'is a registrable domain suffix of or is equal to', with the bundled Public Suffix List), read by svext/webauthn_test.go and browser/test/webauthn.test.mjs alike.",
  "rpId": [
